~ tutorial_start

Serika: Welcome to Serika Social! Let's get you oriented for VR.
Serika: Use the **left thumbstick** to move around your play space.
Serika: Use the **right thumbstick** to snap-turn your view.
Serika: Press the **right A button** to jump.
Serika: Press the **left X button** to sprint while moving.
Serika: Press the **left menu button** to open the pause menu.
Serika: Your hands follow your controllers — reach out and explore!
Serika: Walk into the glowing portal to travel to The Commons — the multiplayer gathering space.
Serika: That's it! Enjoy your time in Serika Social. => END
